=== SURVEY ===
Baseline preserved by this slice
  Code:   internal/api/range_projection_handler.go
          + internal/api/range_projection_handler_compute.go
          (GET /api/v1/vehicles/{vehicleID}/range/projection)
  Heuristic: deterministic linear projection over the last
             RangeProjectionLookbackDays drives + a static
             defaultEfficiency(speedKmh, tempC) Wh/km curve
             that bumps base 155 → 170 above 50 km/h, → 195
             above 90 km/h, and multiplies by 1.35 below 0 °C,
             1.15 below 10 °C, 1.08 above 35 °C. The curve is
             pinned in TestRangeFallbackParity_APIvsMLRange so
             the ML2 fallback (mlrange.HeuristicWhPerKm) and
             the api-side defaultEfficiency cannot drift in
             either direction.
  Page:   web/src/features/battery/pages/ProjectedRangePage.tsx
